### Create target system
POST http://localhost:4000/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My API (local)",
  "allowedOrigins": ["http://localhost:3000"],
  "maxRps": 100,
  "maxConcurrency": 500,
  "mode": "sandbox",
  "approvalThreshold": 5000
}

### List targets
GET http://localhost:4000/api/targets
